{"abstract":[{"text":"Namespace for WebAuthn extensions.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Extension"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"WebAuthn-level extensions that wrap CTAP2 extensions for web compatibility."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"WebAuthn extensions provide a higher-level API that matches the W3C WebAuthn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification. They are built on the underlying "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"s and adapt"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them to WebAuthn API semantics. For example, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is built on the CTAP2"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hmac-secret"},{"type":"text","text":" extension but adds input hashing for domain separation and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exposes a single UV-scoped PRF rather than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hmac-secret"},{"type":"text","text":"’s UV\/non-UV pair."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" filters which extensions it will process via the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"allowedExtensions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter, a "},{"code":"Set<Identifier>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Pass an array literal (e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"[.prf, .credProps]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") or one of the static helpers ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Swift\/Set\/standard","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Swift\/Set\/all","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). Extensions are configured per ceremony on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Registration\/Options\/extensions","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authentication\/Options\/extensions","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and outputs come back on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"clientExtensionResults","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of the corresponding "},{"code":"Response","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let opts = WebAuthn.Registration.Options(","    challenge: challenge,","    rp: .init(id: \"example.com\", name: \"Example\"),","    user: .init(id: userId, name: \"alice@example.com\"),","    extensions: .init(","        prf: .enable,","        credProtect: .enforced(.userVerificationRequired),","        credProps: true","    )",")","let response = try await client.makeCredential(opts, authorization: auth).value"]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/webauthn\/extension"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/Yubi